rive.google.com/drive/folders/1IM9S68plFG76k407YHSb56y1QQ15CQvI?usp=sharing\n\nSNS（Twitter、Twitchなど）でイラストを使いたい。\n\nポーズ、表情、構図はお任せします！  \n\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします！\n良い一日をお過ごしください！~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IM9S68plFG76k407YHSb56y1QQ15CQvI?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mochim_012/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/990a0eed/uploads/origins/621bb25c-652c-41a6-a961-7587170b18fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55012a2409782cb5752d2732fb2c605a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/990a0eed/uploads/origins/621bb25c-652c-41a6-a961-7587170b18fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55012a2409782cb5752d2732fb2c605a, https://si.imgix.net/990a0eed/uploads/origins/621bb25c-652c-41a6-a961-7587170b18fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddc8dd976563c056fb418745bef4b237 2x, https://si.imgix.net/990a0eed/uploads/origins/621bb25c-652c-41a6-a961-7587170b18fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c436817c91768c47827612050eb9e21 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のキャラクター、イージスを描いてくれませんか。\n好きなように描いてください。\n\nお願いを聞いてくれてありがとう。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1D4kgTWvJrEMmwBgmshtCnvffhoLodwGC/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mochim_012/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/51e16a2e/uploads/origins/a5cf39f0-eaee-4c11-b8ed-b1107646ae46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b78b96774d4bcc856bec3ccf352b2070", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51e16a2e/uploads/origins/a5cf39f0-eaee-4c11-b8ed-b1107646ae46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b78b96774d4bcc856bec3ccf352b2070, https://si.imgix.net/51e16a2e/uploads/origins/a5cf39f0-eaee-4c11-b8ed-b1107646ae46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&